nonagon (regular $9$-sided polygon).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995561/assets/d8a917138beb862f6816fc059847659b1ba11e17d6a7a4906309b021baf1d3e5.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-162245/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0c2c755c-59e0-5048-b20c-507f13fce441"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-162245"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-216709/selection/c9ea1962769a902227227a3b59a811ebfbcc8b8753b502f72e31907ae9896e1f" :answer/id #uuid "4a6a5eec-7bbf-50a6-8ea6-9495bc1ce328" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216709/selection/2af19a2be8d2a5b933ccb838459c5c9f8e185f1078367332927f5a0c6fd7f907" :answer/id #uuid "6eccb878-10fd-5782-a89d-fe79f2df90c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216709/selection/1a08b3b102b11c8e8f1d6b5a5b79f95135db9d6b981aefec645f1117ef899cc7" :answer/id #uuid "a0fc62e4-922d-5c84-968e-7c9aa30f931d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{7\\pi \\text{i}/9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216709/selection/60672cd99428f2e0e99c1f7855ff7cf81cb8ef3b4892fbd51ed24837d936b2cf" :answer/id #uuid "752d9baf-25f3-5f35-89cb-7bf3b494e131" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{7\\pi \\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216709/selection/8973a6fcf7b61af7850c5f29483bdb6b13f67812097ea1875e0922a015e243fd" :answer/id #uuid "f29ffb91-710b-5314-9fe3-81339f39922f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{2\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216709/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0fafb208-fdc0-5379-a02a-fd6fd38c13a0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-216709/selection/8973a6fcf7b61af7850c5f29483bdb6b13f67812097ea1875e0922a015e243fd" :answer-field/choices ["q-216709/selection/c9ea1962769a902227227a3b59a811ebfbcc8b8753b502f72e31907ae9896e1f" "q-216709/selection/2af19a2be8d2a5b933ccb838459c5c9f8e185f1078367332927f5a0c6fd7f907" "q-216709/selection/1a08b3b102b11c8e8f1d6b5a5b79f95135db9d6b981aefec645f1117ef899cc7" "q-216709/selection/60672cd99428f2e0e99c1f7855ff7cf81cb8ef3b4892fbd51ed24837d936b2cf" "q-216709/selection/8973a6fcf7b61af7850c5f29483bdb6b13f67812097ea1875e0922a015e243fd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-216709" :question/id #uuid "3ed5b8d5-3a7c-59e2-b811-f15ac112925f" :question/math-academy-id "q-216709" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995561/assets/bf78e90c844df2d80ffb3b08476ecd0370ffbbf63050bcabf20265692b2deeb3.png)\n\nFind the root of unity highlighted in the diagram above." :question/worked-solution "The $n$th roots of unity lie at the vertices of a regular $n$-gon inscribed inside the unit circle in the complex plane. One of the vertices of this regular $n$-gon must lie at the point $(1,0).$\n\nSince there are $9$ points in our diagram, we need to find a $9$th root of unity.\n\nFirst, we express the complex number $1$ in the form $r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta }.$ Notice that $|1|=1$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡(1)=0.$ Hence, \n\n$$\n1={e}^{\\text{i}(0+2k\\pi )}={e}^{2k\\pi \\text{i}},\n$$\n\nwhere $k$ is an integer. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{9}={e}^{2k\\pi \\text{i}}\\,⟹\\,z=({e}^{2k\\pi \\text{i}})^{1/9}={e}^{2k\\pi \\text{i}/9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the index $k$ of our root of unity, we enumerate the roots in the diagram counter-clockwise, starting with the root at $(1,0)$ corresponding to $k=0,$ as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995561/assets/e797056434dc122218bdc501cd9e1d5af93127658daa14f7c38b3bd7be8b877f.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the required root corresponds to $k=3.$ Substituting this into the expression for roots, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}_{3}={e}^{2(3)\\pi \\text{i}/9}={e}^{2\\pi \\text{i}/3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-216709/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b8874325-af33-506b-b24d-3a3e387bd88c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-216709"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-216713/selection/954267f2e7476772482f7af145bd53b9033f399e2789b5873cf805daff857ba7" :answer/id #uuid "77fcdca2-2288-5fb4-9e03-fc7848c3fbf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{3\\pi \\text{i}/4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216713/selection/c9ea1962769a902227227a3b59a811ebfbcc8b8753b502f72e31907ae9896e1f" :answer/id #uuid "fead26a3-a07b-513f-ae78-601a63ca096c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216713/selection/d8e1d49cc9e77a07eb7f20e14967bee39d4cee1d70b41acc66bdbf9f61866c1a" :answer/id #uuid "fae61e6c-f1ed-5f9c-9242-1f6d3f426d67" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216713/selection/2e3243b606ef3d4fac8fb4d3f83b68b29411eabbe0e58fb974473e4b4f9ceb61" :answer/id #uuid "bd1ff5c8-bc2f-56e2-bba2-a7bb1aab5b97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{7\\pi \\text{i}/8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216713/selection/3ab3050c7f33d69345e2e7993068cd9b6fe049827bf7c409d31650fb0e62525c" :answer/id #uuid "15eea9ed-3453-5a51-83cb-59e8194c203a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-216713/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c8a265cf-7daf-569c-8012-a454831bec59" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-216713/selection/954267f2e7476772482f7af145bd53b9033f399e2789b5873cf805daff857ba7" :answer-field/choices ["q-216713/selection/954267f2e7476772482f7af145bd53b9033f399e2789b5873cf805daff857ba7" "q-216713/selection/c9ea1962769a902227227a3b59a811ebfbcc8b8753b502f72e31907ae9896e1f" "q-216713/selection/d8e1d49cc9e77a07eb7f20e14967bee39d4cee1d70b41acc66bdbf9f61866c1a" "q-216713/selection/2e3243b606ef3d4fac8fb4d3f83b68b29411eabbe0e58fb974473e4b4f9ceb61" "q-216713/selection/3ab3050c7f33d69345e2e7993068cd9b6fe049827bf7c409d31650fb0e62525c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-216713" :question/id #uuid "653ed88c-debb-5ddb-9d18-ba57a77e805a" :question/math-academy-id "q-216713" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995561/assets/70665e4b48e324582ff9b1d448580d2e4462cddc7e51ac42a5766bb605d0bf1c.png)\n\nFind the root of unity highlighted in the diagram above." :question/worked-solution "The $n$th roots of unity lie at the vertices of a regular $n$-gon inscribed inside the unit circle in the complex plane. One of the vertices of this regular $n$-gon must lie at the point $(1,0).$\n\nSince there are $8$ points in our diagram, we need to find a $8$th root of unity.\n\nFirst, we express the complex number $1$ in the form $r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta }.$ Notice that $|1|=1$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡(1)=0.$ Hence, \n\n$$\n1={e}^{\\text{i}(0+2k\\pi )}={e}^{2k\\pi \\text{i}},\n$$\n\nwhere $k$ is an integer. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{8}={e}^{2k\\pi \\text{i}}\\,⟹\\,z=({e}^{2k\\pi \\text{i}})^{1/8}={e}^{k\\pi \\text{i}/4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the index $k$ of our root of unity, we enumerate the roots in the diagram counter-clockwise, starting with the root at $(1,0)$ corresponding to $k=0,$ as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995561/assets/31a716f5f4abcda0baea7586f732f9009d2cd4821b429d060d985858c61a3b62.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the required root corresponds to $k=3.$ Substituting this into the expression for roots, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}_{3}={e}^{(3)\\pi \\text{i}/4}={e}^{3\\pi \\text{i}/4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-216713/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b8874325-af33-506b-b24d-3a3e387bd88c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-216713"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
